<p>Regular maintenance catches small issues before they become expensive ones. An annual tune-up improves efficiency, extends system life, and keeps manufacturer warranties valid — many manufacturers require documented annual maintenance to honor a parts warranty at all.<br />Air Zone Experts offers an Annual Maintenance Plan starting at $100/year, including seasonal tune-ups, filter changes, coil cleaning, refrigerant checks, and full system optimization.<br />Between professional visits, homeowners can extend the life of their system by:</p>
