<li>Changing the air filter every 1–3 months</li>
<li>Keeping the outdoor condenser unit clear of leaves, debris, and overgrown landscaping</li>
<li>Making sure vents throughout the home are unobstructed by furniture or rugs</li>
<li>Watching for any of the warning signs listed above and calling before a small issue becomes a bigger one</li>
</ul></div>
